    IDS_TOS_TEXT          "End User License Agreement (EULA)\r\nPlease carefully read this End User License Agreement (hereinafter referred to as the ”Agreement”) before using this chat application (hereinafter referred to as the ”App”). By installing or using the App, the user is deemed to have agreed to be bound by the terms of this Agreement.\r\nArticle 1 (Use of the App)\r\nThe App may only be used by individuals who are 18 years of age or older. Individuals under the age of 18 are not permitted to use the App.\r\nSubject to compliance with the terms of this Agreement, the user is granted a non-exclusive right to use the App. The right to use the App may not be transferred, lent, or sublicensed to any third party.\r\nBy using the App, the user is deemed to have represented and warranted that they are 18 years of age or older.\r\nArticle 2 (Prohibited Acts)\r\nThe user shall not engage in any of the following acts when using the App:\r\n\r\nActs that violate laws or public order and morals\r\nTransmission of content that constitutes harassment, threats, discrimination, or defamation against others\r\nTransmission of obscene, violent, or explicitly sexual content\r\nActs that infringe the intellectual property rights or privacy of third parties\r\nSpam, or unauthorized advertising or promotional activities\r\nReverse engineering, decompiling, disassembling, or otherwise attempting to analyze the structure, functions, or communication processes of the App or its servers\r\n\r\nArticle 3 (Handling of Content and Operational Policy)\r\nThe App is designed not to permanently store users’ communication content on the server. However, information necessary for system operation, such as IP addresses and user IDs, is retained for the purposes of user identification, prevention of unauthorized use, and enforcement of account suspension measures (ban measures) under this Agreement.\r\nAs the App includes user-generated content (UGC), the developer adopts a zero-tolerance policy toward violations of this Agreement. If a violation is confirmed through reports or other means, the developer may, without prior notice, immediately refuse the relevant user’s connection to the server and suspend their use of the App.\r\nThe user shall bear full responsibility for any content they transmit.\r\nArticle 4 (Block and Report Features)\r\nIn order to maintain a healthy environment, the App provides the following features:\r\n\r\nBlock feature: Users may block specific users and prevent further communication with them on their own device.\r\nReport feature: Users may report inappropriate content or users to the operator.\r\n\r\nIf a violation of this Agreement is confirmed through reports or other means, the developer will take appropriate measures, including ban measures against the relevant user.\r\nArticle 5 (Disclaimer)\r\nThe App is provided ”as is.” The developer makes no warranties, express or implied, regarding the completeness, accuracy, fitness for a particular purpose, or continuous availability of the App.\r\nThe developer shall not be liable for any disputes or damages arising between users, or for any damages arising in connection with the use of the App, except in cases of the developer’s willful misconduct or gross negligence.\r\nArticle 6 (Handling of Personal Information)\r\nThe handling of personal information in the App shall be governed by the separately established Privacy Policy.\r\nArticle 7 (Changes to this Agreement)\r\nThe developer may change the contents of this Agreement as necessary. The revised Agreement shall become effective from the time it is announced within the App or on the website, etc. Continued use of the App after such changes shall be deemed as the user’s acceptance of the revised Agreement.\r\nArticle 8 (Governing Law and Jurisdiction)\r\nThe interpretation and application of this Agreement shall be governed by the laws of Japan. All disputes arising in connection with the App shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the Osaka District Court as the court of first instance."
    IDS_AGREE             "Agree"
    IDS_DISAGREE          "Do not agree"
    IDS_YOU             " (You)"
    IDS_SCREEN          " (Screen)"
    IDS_WINDOW          " (Window)"
    IDS_REPORT_TITLE    "Report"
